      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Patients with bariatric needs are likely to experience skin problems because maintaining skin hygiene, particularly between skin folds, can be a challenge. This article is a summary of a literature review that explored the evidence on skin hygiene for people with bariatric needs. The findings reveal a gap in the evidence base and the authors make several recommendations for further research."},
